0030:     - Each 4-connected red object is either a single pixel or a two-pixel horizontal/vertical domino.
0031: 
0032:     Rule
0033:     - Preserve all input pixels.
0034:     - For each red domino, expand its bounding box by one cell in all directions, clipped to the grid.
0035:     - Paint the perimeter of that expanded box green wherever it is currently black.
0036: 
0037:     Key insight
0038:     - The green marks are not drawn around all red pixels, only around the 4-connected red objects of area two.
0039:     """
0040:     g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
